# Compiled Tailwind sheet for the 360px layout guard (`npm run build:layout-css`).
# Built from `app/globals.css` on every `test:layout` run, so it is derived, never
# edited, and never reviewed. It lives under `test/` rather than the frontend root
# because `test/color-tokens.test.ts` pins the exact list of loose root files.
